# pro.radiation-lab.com — response headers for the Cloudflare Worker `radiation-lab-pro` (static assets). T8, 2026-10-28.
# .github/workflows/deploy.yml copies this file to dist/_headers. It is kept out of public/ so Vercel never serves it as a file.
#
# The first block keeps what Vercel sent on every response (measured 2026-10-28): CORS * and HSTS for two years.
# The Cloudflare zone does not add HSTS (the apex answers without it), so it is set here.
/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000
# Vite fingerprints everything under assets/, so it can be cached for a year (Vercel sent max-age=0 there).
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
